    "bio": "A Representative from Ohio; born in Hillsboro, Highland County, Ohio, January 12, 1950; attended the public schools; B.B.A., University of Miami, Coral Gables, Fla., 1972; business executive; served in the Ohio house of representatives 1974-1980; delegate, Republican National Conventions, 1974-1978; elected as a Republican to the Ninety-seventh and to the five succeeding Congresses (January 3, 1981-January 3, 1993); unsuccessful candidate for reelection to the One Hundred Third Congress; is a resident of Hillsboro, Ohio.",
